* Mutant: No active device: 100 ohm terminations to vocm in parallel with a 50/50 ohm divider to each output,
* and 1 kohm on iref. Has no active path at the nominal point, so no check is scored.
.subckt ctle_28g vss vdd iref vocm vinp vinn gain_b0 gain_b1 peak_b0 peak_b1 voutp voutn
RIREF iref vss 1k
RTP vinp vocm 100
RTN vinn vocm 100
R1P vinp voutp 50
R2P voutp vocm 50
R1N vinn voutn 50
R2N voutn vocm 50
.ends ctle_28g
